@startuml
autonumber
hide footbox
title US012 - Get the list of publications in my library (With DTO)


actor User
participant ":UI012" as UI



participant ":GetListOfPublicationsInLibraryController" as Ctrl



participant ":PublicationMapper" as Mapper
participant "pubDTO:PublicationDTO" as DTO



participant ":Library" as LibDomain
participant "listOfPublications:List<Publication>" as ListPubs
participant "listOfPublicationsDTO:List<PublicationDTO>" as ListDTO

participant ":Publication" as PubDomain




User -> UI : asks to see a list of publications in library
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: getListOfPublicationsInLibrary()
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> LibDomain: getListOfPublicationsInLibrary()
activate LibDomain
LibDomain -> ListPubs **:


LibDomain --> Ctrl: listOfPublications
deactivate LibDomain

Ctrl -> Mapper: toDTO(listOfPublications)
activate Mapper
Mapper -> ListDTO **:


    loop for each publication in list
        Mapper -> PubDomain: getDetails()
        activate PubDomain
        PubDomain --> Mapper: details
        deactivate PubDomain

        Mapper -> DTO ** : create(details)
        activate DTO
        DTO --> Mapper : pubDTO
        deactivate DTO

        Mapper -> Mapper: listOfPublicationsDTO.add(pubDTO)
    end

Mapper --> Ctrl: listOfPublicationsDTO
deactivate Mapper

Ctrl --> UI: listOfPublicationsDTO
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> User : shows the list of publications with details
deactivate UI
@enduml